  "draft_py": "# Crusader of Odric (FDN), a */* Human Soldier for {2}{W}.\n# \"Crusader of Odric's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.\"\n# M21 Kinetic Augur's verified B5b-set-pt-power-gy-instant-sorcery (\"Kinetic Augur's power is equal\n#   to the number of ...\": a StaticAbility SET_PT on the source, the QCount the power) with both\n#   power and toughness. \"The number of creatures you control\" is ZNR Kabira Takedown's verified\n#   QCount (ALL your creatures on the battlefield), the Crusader itself included.\ncreatures_you_control = QCount(\n    selector=Selector(\n        count=QUnbounded(),\n        mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n        filter=FAnd(\n            children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            ),\n        ),\n        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n    ),\n)\ncda = StaticAbility(\n    effect=A(Verb.SET_PT, {\n        'power': creatures_you_control,\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QConst(value=1),\n            mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n            filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n        'toughness': creatures_you_control,\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [cda, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Crusader of Odric's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures you control.",
